## Optionally configure RoCE on *compute nodes*

When RoCE has a network of its own (see [Optionally add RoCE support on *head
node*](#optionally-add-roce-support-on-head-node)), give each compute its own
address `${c_roce[i]}` on the RoCE interface `${roce_dev}`, with the
`${roce_netmask}` netmask (`${roce_prefix_length}` prefix). These are per-node
settings, so they belong in the {{ provisioner_name }} node definitions:

{% include "provisioner/" ~ provisioner ~ "/compute-roce.md.j2" %}
